From 9e26f6d8ee5827b0f36bb52e9882aea008fe5a23 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Translation Patch Toolkit <translation@local>
Date: Mon, 25 May 2026 12:43:47 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] 翻译 code/modules/jobs/job_types/roguetown/nobility/bailiff.dm
